== Founding ==
[[File:Nihongi_by_Aston_djvu_109.jpg|left|thumb]]
In Ancient times Amaterasu ordered Uzume to accompany her grandson [[Ninigi]] on his journey to earth. They headed to ''[[Ame-no-ukihashi]]'' ("floating bridge of heaven") so they could head to earth but they were blocked by [[Sarutahiko Ōkami|Sarutahiko]]. Uzume came and persuaded Sarutahiko to let Ninigi pass, in other versions of the story Uzume flirts with Sarutahiko.

