{{Expand Japanese}}{{Infobox Japanese clan|province of origin=[[Ise Province]]|home province=[[Ise Province]]|founder={{ill|Ama-no-Uzume|Ame-no-Uzume|en||simple}} and {{ill|Sarutahiko Ōkami|en||simple|User:Immanuelle/Sarutahiko Ōkami|fr}}|image=File:Sarume Shrine.jpg|caption=Sarume shrine, a subshrine of [[Sarutahiko Shrine]], the traditional shrine of the family|image caption=Sarume shrine, a subshrine of [[Sarutahiko Shrine]], the traditional shrine of the family<ref name="web.archive.org-2023a" /><ref name="web.archive.org-2022" /><ref name="web.archive.org-2023b" /><ref name="www.kankomie.or.jp" />
